WEBVTT

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:31.121
And this is notable because,
as I mentioned before,

00:01:31.121 --> 00:01:33.829
in the triage of finding movies
to make and making them,

00:01:34.371 --> 00:01:36.829
there's a lot of relying
on conventional wisdom

00:01:37.913 --> 00:01:40.454
and that conventional wisdom maybe,

00:01:40.746 --> 00:01:43.996
just maybe might be wrong to
even greater consequence.

00:01:45.413 --> 00:01:47.496
Films about black people
don't sell overseas.

00:01:48.871 --> 00:01:52.413
Female driven action movies don't work
because women will see themselves in men,

00:01:52.413 --> 00:01:54.079
but men won't see themselves and women

00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:59.454
that no one wants to see. Movies
about women over 40 that are

00:01:59.454 --> 00:02:01.246
on screen heroes have to conform to